  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Log_Begone/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4vEKxfK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574529906076286996?color=blue&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"285\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp; <br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Log_Begone/BH_NU_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">《Log Begone》為《Shut Up Console by&nbsp;Bravarly》的分支版本，主要功能是當您移除結構、生態系、方塊或物品時，自動過濾掉遊戲日誌中不斷噴出「遺失」字樣的惱人訊息。預設情況下，它也會一併過濾掉與 the_aether 相關的日誌垃圾訊息，因為該模組由近期已移除該功能的整合包所開發。</span></p>",
